WEBVTT

00:11:28.787 --> 00:11:30.746
I think it was that sense is that.

00:11:32.037 --> 00:11:34.037
That I'm secure and safe in the world

00:11:34.037 --> 00:11:37.454
and that I'm strong enough
to face anything really

00:11:37.871 --> 00:11:41.787
and to really step into that knowledge,

00:11:42.079 --> 00:11:45.496
not that you'll be like always brave
or always do the right thing

00:11:45.496 --> 00:11:51.037
or always accept what's happening
in in a sort of graceful way

00:11:51.037 --> 00:11:55.579
or courageous way. But that at my deepest,
deepest, deepest place within me,

00:11:55.829 --> 00:12:01.162
I believe in the power of my own
resilience and ability to survive